{"openapi": "3.0.2", "info": {"title": "Glances REST API", "version": "5"}, "paths": {"/status": {"get": {"tags": ["health"], "summary": "Status Handler", "operationId": "status_handler_status_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {}}}}}}}, "/healthz": {"get": {"tags": ["health"], "summary": "Status Handler", "operationId": "status_handler_healthz_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {}}}}}}}, "/api/5/token": {"post": {"tags": ["v5", "auth"], "summary": "Issue Token", "operationId": "issue_token_api_5_token_post", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {}}}}}, "security": [{"HTTPBasic": []}]}}, "/api/5/pluginslist": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Plugins List", "operationId": "plugins_list_api_5_pluginslist_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "type": "array", "title": "Response Plugins List Api 5 Pluginslist Get"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/all": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "All Stats", "operationId": "all_stats_api_5_all_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response All Stats Api 5 All Get"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/all/limits": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "All Limits", "operationId": "all_limits_api_5_all_limits_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response All Limits Api 5 All Limits Get"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/all/info": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "All Info", "description": "Every registered plugin's schema, published or not (G9-5).\n\nA schema is static, unlike the payloads /all skips at cycle 0. The WebUI\nfetches this once per page load.", "operationId": "all_info_api_5_all_info_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response All Info Api 5 All Info Get"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/alert": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Alert History", "operationId": "alert_history_api_5_alert_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"items": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object"}, "type": "array", "title": "Response Alert History Api 5 Alert Get"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/alert/incidents": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Alert Incidents", "description": "The alert history collapsed into incidents \u2014 the same synthesis\nthe TUI's alert block paints (glances/alerts_incidents_v5.py).\n\nModule-level rather than a closure inside `build_router()`, like\n`_all_info` above: that factory was already at ruff's complexity\nceiling, so every route added inside it pushes it over.\n\nA second projection of the same data as ``/alert``, not a\nreplacement: that route stays the raw transition-log export\ncontract.\n\nEach incident also carries a ``duration``: the same formatted,\n``>``-prefixed-when-``partial`` string the curses renderer shows\n(`incident_duration()`, also from `glances.alerts_incidents_v5`).\nComputed here rather than left to the caller so the browser cannot\ngrow a second implementation of the ``partial`` \u2192 ``>`` rule \u2014 a\nclient that dropped that prefix would print a lower bound as an\nexact duration. ``duration`` is always present in the response;\nits value is ``null`` for the handful of malformed/unknown cases\n`incident_duration()` itself returns ``None`` for (see its\ndocstring), which a consumer must treat as \"unknown\", not as a\nmissing key.\n\n`derive_incidents()` is pure and builds every incident dict fresh\n(never a reference into `alerts._history` or `alerts._state`), so\nmutating the returned dicts in place to add `duration` does not\ntouch anything the engine still owns.\n\nReturns an envelope, not a bare array: ``is_initializing`` is\n``GlancesAlerts.is_initializing()``, the same flag\n`render_alert_block` uses to tell \"warm-up\" from \"no alert\ndetected\" (curses_renderer_v5.py:738-745) \u2014 warm-up is not an\nall-clear, so a client must be able to tell the two apart instead\nof reading an empty ``incidents`` list as a healthy system from the\nvery first paint (fix round 2, IMPORTANT 2). No consumer of this\nroute predates this change, so the shape is still free to pick.", "operationId": "alert_incidents_api_5_alert_incidents_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Alert Incidents Api 5 Alert Incidents Get"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/serverslist": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Servers List", "description": "The browser's server list (`-s --browser`), for the Web UI browser page.\n\nCVE-2026-32633: v4 served each server's `uri`, which carried the\npassword hash. `ServerEntry.as_dict()` names every key it returns, and\nan entry holds no credential to begin with (`glances/servers_list_v5.py`).", "operationId": "servers_list_api_5_serverslist_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"items": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object"}, "type": "array", "title": "Response Servers List Api 5 Serverslist Get"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/config": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Config Dump", "description": "The redacted config behind a password, else only the WebUI keys.\n\nWithout a password anyone who reaches the API reads this route, and a\nredaction keyed on option names leaks the secrets held in free-form\nvalues (security audit 2026-10-04, M1).", "operationId": "config_dump_api_5_config_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Config Dump Api 5 Config Get"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/args": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Args Dump", "description": "Return the CLI argument namespace, redacted (issue #1527 / CVE-2026-68520).", "operationId": "args_dump_api_5_args_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Args Dump Api 5 Args Get"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/processes/extended/disable": {"post": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Unpin Extended Process", "description": "Stop collecting extended stats for whichever process was pinned.", "operationId": "unpin_extended_process_api_5_processes_extended_disable_post", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "boolean", "title": "Response Unpin Extended Process Api 5 Processes Extended Disable Post"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/processes/extended/{pid}": {"post": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Pin Extended Process", "description": "Collect extended stats for `pid` from the next cycle on.\n\n404 on a pid the process list does not carry, as v4 does \u2014 v4 reaches\nthat through `int(pid)`, which raises `ValueError` (\u2192 500) on garbage;\nhere FastAPI's path type rejects it with a 422 before the handler runs.", "operationId": "pin_extended_process_api_5_processes_extended__pid__post", "parameters": [{"name": "pid", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "title": "Pid"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "boolean", "title": "Response Pin Extended Process Api 5 Processes Extended  Pid  Post"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/processes/sort/{key}": {"post": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Sort Processes", "description": "Sort the processes (and the containers and VMs) by `key`, or `auto`.", "operationId": "sort_processes_api_5_processes_sort__key__post", "parameters": [{"name": "key", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Key"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "boolean", "title": "Response Sort Processes Api 5 Processes Sort  Key  Post"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/{plugin_name}/history": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Plugin History", "operationId": "plugin_history_api_5__plugin_name__history_get", "parameters": [{"name": "plugin_name", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Plugin Name"}}, {"name": "nb", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "description": "Last nb points (0 = all).", "default": 0, "title": "Nb"}, "description": "Last nb points (0 = all)."}, {"name": "field", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "description": "One historised field.", "title": "Field"}, "description": "One historised field."}, {"name": "item", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "description": "One item of a collection plugin (raw primary-key value).", "title": "Item"}, "description": "One item of a collection plugin (raw primary-key value)."}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Plugin History Api 5  Plugin Name  History Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/{plugin_name}/info": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Plugin Info", "operationId": "plugin_info_api_5__plugin_name__info_get", "parameters": [{"name": "plugin_name", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Plugin Name"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Plugin Info Api 5  Plugin Name  Info Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/{plugin_name}/limits": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Plugin Limits", "operationId": "plugin_limits_api_5__plugin_name__limits_get", "parameters": [{"name": "plugin_name", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Plugin Name"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Plugin Limits Api 5  Plugin Name  Limits Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/{plugin_name}": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Plugin Payload", "operationId": "plugin_payload_api_5__plugin_name__get", "parameters": [{"name": "plugin_name", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Plugin Name"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/{plugin_name}/top/{n}": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Plugin Top", "description": "The first n items of a collection plugin, as a bare list (v4 `/top/<n>`).", "operationId": "plugin_top_api_5__plugin_name__top__n__get", "parameters": [{"name": "plugin_name", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Plugin Name"}}, {"name": "n", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "title": "N"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/{plugin_name}/{field}": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Plugin Field", "description": "One field: `{field: value}`, a list of values for a collection (v4 `/<plugin>/<item>`).", "operationId": "plugin_field_api_5__plugin_name___field__get", "parameters": [{"name": "plugin_name", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Plugin Name"}}, {"name": "field", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Field"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/{plugin_name}/{field}/value/{value}": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Plugin Value", "description": "The items whose field equals value: `{value: [items]}` (v4 `/<plugin>/<item>/value/<value>`).", "operationId": "plugin_value_api_5__plugin_name___field__value__value__get", "parameters": [{"name": "plugin_name", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Plugin Name"}}, {"name": "field", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Field"}}, {"name": "value", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Value"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/api/5/{plugin_name}/{field}/{pk_value}": {"get": {"tags": ["v5"], "summary": "Plugin Item Field", "description": "One field of the item whose primary key is pk_value (v4 `/<plugin>/<item>/<key>`).", "operationId": "plugin_item_field_api_5__plugin_name___field___pk_value__get", "parameters": [{"name": "plugin_name", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Plugin Name"}}, {"name": "field", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Field"}}, {"name": "pk_value", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Pk Value"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}}, "components": {"schemas": {"HTTPValidationError": {"properties": {"detail": {"items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"}, "type": "array", "title": "Detail"}}, "type": "object", "title": "HTTPValidationError"}, "ValidationError": {"properties": {"loc": {"items": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "integer"}]}, "type": "array", "title": "Location"}, "msg": {"type": "string", "title": "Message"}, "type": {"type": "string", "title": "Error Type"}, "input": {"title": "Input"}, "ctx": {"type": "object", "title": "Context"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["loc", "msg", "type"], "title": "ValidationError"}}, "securitySchemes": {"HTTPBasic": {"type": "http", "scheme": "basic"}}}}